 "cues": [
  {
   "id": "1.town",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.5333,
   "text": "In this town, I was the only one who was not a monster. And I was in a cage."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.night",
   "start": 3.5333,
   "end": 5.4333,
   "text": "It was night. Half of the castle was asleep."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.shift",
   "start": 5.4333,
   "end": 7.0,
   "text": "The other half was on the night shift."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.asleep",
   "start": 7.0,
   "end": 10.2333,
   "text": "I was asleep too. So I did not see any of this. They told me later."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.guard",
   "start": 10.2333,
   "end": 12.3667,
   "text": "One guard woke up in his room. He could not sleep."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.sheep",
   "start": 12.3667,
   "end": 14.9333,
   "text": "He looked at the ceiling. He counted sheep. It did not work."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.air",
   "start": 14.9333,
   "end": 16.8333,
   "text": "So he went outside, for some fresh air."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.stars",
   "start": 16.8333,
   "end": 19.3667,
   "text": "It was a nice night. There were stars. He took a big breath."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.bush",
   "start": 19.3667,
   "end": 20.4,
   "text": "Then a bush moved."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.who",
   "start": 20.4,
   "end": 22.5333,
   "text": "\"Who is there?\" he said. The bush did not say."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.sword",
   "start": 22.5333,
   "end": 24.7,
   "text": "He pulled out his sword. He walked up to the bush."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.slow",
   "start": 24.7,
   "end": 26.2,
   "text": "Slowly. Very slowly."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.bam",
   "start": 26.2,
   "end": 28.9667,
   "text": "BAM! It was my dad. With his jaw wide open."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.scream",
   "start": 28.9667,
   "end": 31.3,
   "text": "The guard screamed. It was a very long scream."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.sorry",
   "start": 31.3,
   "end": 34.6667,
   "text": "My dad was meant to be quiet. He put his jaw back. \"Sorry,\" he said."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.lights",
   "start": 34.6667,
   "end": 37.2,
   "text": "The whole castle heard it. A light went on in every window."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.tower",
   "start": 37.2,
   "end": 39.5333,
   "text": "Up on the tower, one player was asleep on the job."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.glass",
   "start": 39.5333,
   "end": 42.6667,
   "text": "He woke up. He picked up his spyglass. He looked at the forest."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.trees",
   "start": 42.6667,
   "end": 45.9,
   "text": "Trees. Trees. Trees. Then the trees moved."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.pill",
   "start": 45.9,
   "end": 47.3333,
   "text": "Pillagers. Hundreds of them."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.gers",
   "start": 47.3333,
   "end": 52.0,
   "text": "And vindicators. And evokers. And witches. And some I do not know the name of."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.vex",
   "start": 52.0,
   "end": 54.9333,
   "text": "Then something small and blue filled the whole spyglass. A vex."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.face",
   "start": 54.9333,
   "end": 56.0667,
   "text": "It flew right at his face."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.woke",
   "start": 56.0667,
   "end": 57.0667,
   "text": "That is when I woke up."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.fell",
   "start": 57.0667,
   "end": 60.0,
   "text": "Behind me, somebody fell off a tower. I did not see that either."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.boom",
   "start": 60.0,
   "end": 63.2333,
   "text": "Then the wall exploded. BOOM! The pillagers had brought TNT."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.ran",
   "start": 63.2333,
   "end": 67.3,
   "text": "The villagers ran. Not away. They ran to the big gate. And they let it out."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.golem",
   "start": 67.3,
   "end": 69.4667,
   "text": "The iron golem. It was as tall as a house."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.steps",
   "start": 69.4667,
   "end": 71.7667,
   "text": "It walked through the smoke. Every step shook my cage."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.angry",
   "start": 71.7667,
   "end": 75.0333,
   "text": "The pillagers were not scared. They were angry. They opened a gate of their own."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.ravager",
   "start": 75.0333,
   "end": 77.1333,
   "text": "A ravager. With a pillager riding on top."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.clash",
   "start": 77.1333,
   "end": 80.5333,
   "text": "They ran at each other. The golem's fist. The ravager's jaw. The ground shook."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.again",
   "start": 80.5333,
   "end": 82.8333,
   "text": "The ravager went back ten steps. Then it came again."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.pop",
   "start": 82.8333,
   "end": 86.2,
   "text": "Then, pop. Somebody was standing at my cage. The enderman teacher."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.key",
   "start": 86.2,
   "end": 89.0667,
   "text": "He had a key. He was trying it in the lock. His hands were shaking."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.where",
   "start": 89.0667,
   "end": 90.8333,
   "text": "\"Where did you get that key?\" I said."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.ask",
   "start": 90.8333,
   "end": 92.4333,
   "text": "\"Do not ask,\" he said."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.earlier",
   "start": 92.4333,
   "end": 98.3667,
   "text": "Four minutes earlier."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.hole",
   "start": 98.3667,
   "end": 101.5,
   "text": "Then they came through the hole in the wall. My friends. All of them!"
  },
  {
   "id": "7.all",
   "start": 101.5,
   "end": 105.3667,
   "text": "My mum. My dad. Hiss. The zombies. The skeletons. The spiders."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.armour",
   "start": 105.3667,
   "end": 108.8,
   "text": "On the other side, the villagers and the players put on their armour. All of it."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.help",
   "start": 108.8,
   "end": 109.6,
   "text": "It did not help."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.zombie",
   "start": 109.6,
   "end": 111.6,
   "text": "A zombie took a sword, and bent it."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.skel",
   "start": 111.6,
   "end": 114.1333,
   "text": "A skeleton shot a helmet off. Then the one under it."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.spider",
   "start": 114.1333,
   "end": 115.9667,
   "text": "A spider tied three players together."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.mum",
   "start": 115.9667,
   "end": 119.8667,
   "text": "My mum did not fight. She walked through all of them, looking for me. Nobody stopped her."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.hiss",
   "start": 119.8667,
   "end": 122.0333,
   "text": "And Hiss only had to walk at them. They ran."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.bus",
   "start": 122.0333,
   "end": 124.8333,
   "text": "Then the bus arrived. It came over the wall. Splat."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.click",
   "start": 124.8333,
   "end": 126.3,
   "text": "Click. My cage was open."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.in",
   "start": 126.3,
   "end": 129.9333,
   "text": "\"Get in!\" said the teacher. I got in the bus. I was wet. I did not care."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.mo",
   "start": 129.9333,
   "end": 132.0333,
   "text": "Then I looked out through the slime. And I saw Mo."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.down",
   "start": 132.0333,
   "end": 133.9667,
   "text": "He was down on the ground. He was not moving."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.drag",
   "start": 133.9667,
   "end": 136.4333,
   "text": "Two guards had him by the arms. They were dragging him away."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.out",
   "start": 136.4333,
   "end": 137.4667,
   "text": "I jumped out of the bus."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.look",
   "start": 137.4667,
   "end": 140.4,
   "text": "Everybody turned to look at me. My mum. My dad. All of them."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.nobody",
   "start": 140.4,
   "end": 141.8333,
   "text": "And nobody was looking at the golem."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.flick",
   "start": 141.8333,
   "end": 143.6333,
   "text": "It ran right at the bus. One flick."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.forest",
   "start": 143.6333,
   "end": 145.7667,
   "text": "The bus went over the wall, and into the forest."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.fist",
   "start": 145.7667,
   "end": 147.7667,
   "text": "Then the golem turned to me. It lifted its fist."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.slam",
   "start": 147.7667,
   "end": 151.0667,
   "text": "SLAM! The ravager hit it from the side. They both went through a house."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.ran",
   "start": 151.0667,
   "end": 154.2333,
   "text": "I ran. And somebody ran after me. Small feet. Hiss."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.stay",
   "start": 154.2333,
   "end": 156.3667,
   "text": "\"Stay back!\" shouted the teacher. \"Both of you!\""
  },
  {
   "id": "9.never",
   "start": 156.3667,
   "end": 159.1667,
   "text": "Hiss did not stay back. Hiss had never stayed back in his life."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.door",
   "start": 159.1667,
   "end": 161.1,
   "text": "The castle door was open. I went in."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.hall",
   "start": 161.1,
   "end": 165.0,
   "text": "It was a hallway. Long, and thin. So thin I could touch both walls."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.mo",
   "start": 165.0,
   "end": 168.4,
   "text": "At the far end, two guards. And Mo, on the floor between them."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.run",
   "start": 168.4,
   "end": 169.8,
   "text": "I ran at them."
  },
  {
   "id": "11.sub",
   "start": 169.8,
   "end": 171.6333,
   "text": "Like and subscribe for part five."
  }
 ],
